// aes-tables.mjs
//
// Constant lookup tables for the AES (Rijndael) block cipher, as defined in
// FIPS-197. These tables are pure data and are shared by the key-expansion
// and block-transformation routines in aes-core.mjs.

// Forward S-box: substitution values for the byte xy (in hexadecimal
// format {xy}), i.e. the multiplicative inverse in GF(2^8) followed by the
// AES affine transformation.
